== About Me

I obtained the Ph.D. degree (advised by [http://www.math.uestc.edu.cn/info/1081/2041.htm Prof. Ting-Zhu Huang] and [https://zhaoxile.github.io/ Prof. Xi-Le Zhao]) with the [http://www.math.uestc.edu.cn/index.htm School of Mathematical Sciences], [https://www.uestc.edu.cn/ University of Electronic Science and Technology of China (UESTC)], Chengdu, China. 

