- 09/2018-12/2022: [https://www.uestc.edu.cn/ University of Electronic Science and Technology of China (UESTC)]; Ph. D. student in Applied Mathematics (Supervisor: [http://www.math.uestc.edu.cn/info/1081/2041.htm Prof. Ting-Zhu Huang])

- 09/2019-09/2020: [https://oregonstate.edu/ Oregon State University]; Exchange visitor in Signal Processing (Supervisor: [https://web.engr.oregonstate.edu/~fuxia/ Prof. Xiao Fu] and [http://www.math.uestc.edu.cn/info/1081/2041.htm Prof. Ting-Zhu Huang])

